Patch 2015 (diagnostic, off by default): TEX_DDS_DUMP=<from_frame>:<max> writes level 0 of BC1/BC3 uploads as .dds files named by
guest offset; a capture manifest op ends with fh=<fragment-program code hash>; FP_DUMP_FROM=<frame> writes every program compiled
from that frame to a .hlsl file named by its hash; FP_PICK also takes a comma list.

